{"ref":"BDB, אֶ֫לֶף","hw":"אֶ֫לֶף","html":"† I. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אֶ֫לֶף</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Psalms 8:8\" href=\"/Psalms.8.8\">ψ 8:8</a></sup>; only pl. <strong>cattle (</strong>Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">אלף</span>, Assyrian <em>alpu</em>, COT<sup>Gloss.</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">אֲלָפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.4\">Pr 14:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.24\">Is 30:24</a> used in tillage; subject to man <a data-ref=\"Psalms 8:8\" href=\"/Psalms.8.8\">ψ 8:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹנֶה</span>); their increase <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁגַר אֲלָפֶיךָ</span> a blessing <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.13\">Dt 7:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.4\">28:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:51\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.51\">51</a> (‖ all <span dir=\"rtl\">עַשְׁתְּרֹת צֹאנֶ֑ךָ</span>).","next":"BDB, אַלּוּף","prev":"BDB, אָלַף"}